        <activityName xml:lang="en">Normal concrete, C20/25, with resource correction, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Normal concrete, C20/25, with resource correction, at plant
Modern European an Swiss technologies are applied. 
UUID: 464d2f5b-ef40-489f-887c-60498b087cc8
This dataset documents the production of Concrete, C20/25  in Switzerland, following European standards. Data based on primary data collected from ready mix plant and adopted from "concrete production, 20 MPa, RNA only, GLO 2006".
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Production of Concrete C20/25.
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_464d2f5b-ef40-489f-887c-60498b087cc8.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
